{"summary":"Cute role-playing game with unique roles!","description":"Feign is a role-playing game with maximum 12 players that takes place in a small town where innocents, imposters and neutrals together. You use your role at night to win and send a person from the village in the morning.\n\nINSANE\n\nInsane is a unique role of Feign\nInsane is an innocent role however it is dangerous for the innocents.\nIf you have the Insane(innocent) role you don't see that. You think and see that you are some other innocent role.\nIf you are Insane (innocent), you can think you are an investigator and give wrong information during the whole game.\nMaybe all the innocents are killed because of you. Can you be... insane?\n\nINNOCENTS\n\nCollect information at night using your role and try not to die.\nFind out who is the imposter in the morning.\nSend people you think are imposter from the village by voting\n\nIMPOSTERS\n\nKill innocents using your role at night or gather information to avoid attracting attention.\nTry not to be caught by innocents in the morning.\n\nNEUTRALS\n\nFulfill your own role without getting involved with Innocents or Imposters.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence, Mild Blood","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VK0S-N02tm8?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/so0GBDQTkoPz4OpgG-ToTp4MHYK623ARFr-N5rm9OrWmpPIDhXOJiki3gXsrwzgKE8s8Vxd1fQV8qMRnHjZZic8","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/riX0qsIF2dHL9Lwj3Os-Qx6BmN0iZkoNoBkKNJWsmsTWXtAFXRHr1Uq7Vsbi-P8MzkH5ULB5SJUFZoGz6LJLfQA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YV3tNO2YuffaxLvFtG4Z1YEGemFQmz0oG3jnQQV7cp_-f4Ji_7IC2K7bC2hncyBPSG2lvjLFfcoN8G3JeErkjg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tO4aisl0QHbPYnBp_Up85YLMHOG_rl85AEX7io_3d_RVHOHwn4ZTTyqPi77csRD1JO1sawtiQKVbkqRn2uvhcw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zx6hDwVihfydKtYnDPIE1G-13MF9-qu0yqTYGbTKCY4OYcPLccw62jCPj_KnKBsfX-sc-HvFNNnUaFJOrZ6W","http